WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.621 --> 00:00:16.206
A few days later, Pollyanna brought Fluffy to visit Mrs.

2
00:00:16.286 --> 00:00:22.368
Snow. While they were having fun watching the cat play, Mrs.

3
00:00:22.428 --> 00:00:24.469
Snow suddenly remembered something important.

4
00:00:24.489 --> 00:00:29.371
"Milly is doing errands, and I meant to ask her to stop by Dr.

5
00:00:29.411 --> 00:00:30.712
Chilton's," Mrs.

6
00:00:30.752 --> 00:00:31.252
Snow said.

7
00:00:32.416 --> 00:00:34.198
"He prescribed a new medicine for me.

8
00:00:35.178 --> 00:00:38.701
But I can't remember the name or how many times a day to take it.

9
00:00:39.782 --> 00:00:40.242
Oh, dear!

10
00:00:40.703 --> 00:00:41.823
What am I going to do?"

11
00:00:43.825 --> 00:00:45.646
Pollyanna hopped up, eager to help.

12
00:00:45.686 --> 00:00:49.309
"I'd be glad to run over to his office and ask him."

13
00:00:49.329 --> 00:00:52.392
"That would be wonderful!"

14
00:00:54.733 --> 00:00:57.716
Pollyanna was happy to be outside on such a beautiful day.

15
00:00:59.628 --> 00:01:00.509
When she reached Dr.

16
00:01:00.549 --> 00:01:02.750
Chilton's office, he welcomed her at the door.

17
00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.692
"Pollyanna, your timing is perfect," Dr.

18
00:01:06.712 --> 00:01:07.352
Chilton said.

19
00:01:07.372 --> 00:01:10.173
"I've just seen my last patient of the day.

20
00:01:10.554 --> 00:01:13.015
What can I do for you?"

21
00:01:13.035 --> 00:01:16.457
"Mrs. Snow can't remember the name of the medicine you told her to buy.

22
00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:19.758
She also needs to know how often to take it."

23
00:01:19.778 --> 00:01:23.100
"Come in, and I'll write that down for her."

24
00:01:27.616 --> 00:01:31.138
Dr. Chilton beckoned Pollyanna inside and sat down at his desk.

25
00:01:32.278 --> 00:01:35.779
Pollyanna looked around the room while he wrote a note on a pad of paper.

26
00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:37.660
Besides Dr.

27
00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:42.702
Chilton's desk, the room contained several chairs as well as a bookcase filled with medical texts.

28
00:01:44.743 --> 00:01:49.165
Through an open door, Pollyanna spotted an examining table and a glass-front cabinet.

29
00:01:50.485 --> 00:01:53.207
It contained a microscope and a model of the human body.

30
00:01:54.567 --> 00:01:56.308
There were also a chest and a cot.

31
00:01:58.332 --> 00:02:00.514
Everything appeared neat and well-organized.

32
00:02:00.534 --> 00:02:05.378
"I've never been inside your home before," Pollyanna said.

33
00:02:05.398 --> 00:02:08.861
"This is your home as well as your office, right?"

34
00:02:08.881 --> 00:02:12.484
"Yes, but it's a poor excuse for a home.

35
00:02:13.525 --> 00:02:14.506
These are just rooms.

36
00:02:15.506 --> 00:02:16.527
They aren't really a home."

37
00:02:18.669 --> 00:02:20.350
Pollyanna nodded in sympathy.

38
00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:27.890
"Yes, I've heard someone say it takes a spouse's hand and heart or a child's presence to make

39
00:02:27.930 --> 00:02:28.851
a house a home."

40
00:02:30.631 --> 00:02:33.793
"What?" The doctor spun around in his chair.

41
00:02:33.813 --> 00:02:35.313
"That's what Mr.

42
00:02:35.353 --> 00:02:36.314
Pendleton told me."

43
00:02:36.634 --> 00:02:37.514
Pollyanna paused.

44
00:02:37.534 --> 00:02:40.676
"Why don't you get a woman's hand and heart, Dr.

45
00:02:40.716 --> 00:02:44.737
Chilton? Or maybe you'd take Jimmy Bean, if Mr.

46
00:02:44.777 --> 00:02:46.038
Pendleton doesn't want him.

47
00:02:47.338 --> 00:02:50.780
Jimmy's a really nice orphan, and he's willing to work too.

48
00:02:51.948 --> 00:02:54.350
But I'm not sure he made the best impression on Mr.

49
00:02:54.370 --> 00:02:56.732
Pendleton." Dr.

50
00:02:56.772 --> 00:02:59.935
Chilton gave a slight smile as he turned back toward his desk.

51
00:02:59.955 --> 00:03:02.236
"So Mr.

52
00:03:02.317 --> 00:03:05.699
Pendleton thinks it takes a spouse's hand and heart to make a home?"

53
00:03:07.381 --> 00:03:10.603
"Yes, he says his mansion is just a house too.

54
00:03:11.744 --> 00:03:13.165
So why don't you, Dr.

55
00:03:13.205 --> 00:03:15.467
Chilton?" "Why don't I what?"

56
00:03:15.487 --> 00:03:18.370
"Get a woman's hand and heart.

57
00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:20.992
Oh, I almost forgot to tell you!

58
00:03:21.788 --> 00:03:23.268
It wasn't Aunt Polly who Mr.

59
00:03:23.288 --> 00:03:26.809
Pendleton loved long ago, so we aren't going to live with him.

60
00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:30.590
I made a mistake when I told you it was Aunt Polly."

61
00:03:31.731 --> 00:03:33.151
Pollyanna looked anxious.

62
00:03:33.171 --> 00:03:36.772
"I hope you didn't tell anyone."

63
00:03:36.792 --> 00:03:40.533
"No, I didn't tell anyone."

64
00:03:43.894 --> 00:03:45.394
Pollyanna sighed with relief.

65
00:03:45.414 --> 00:03:47.875
"Oh, then it's all right.

66
00:03:48.935 --> 00:03:50.756
But you still haven't answered my question.

67
00:03:51.756 --> 00:03:52.997
Why don't you get a spouse?"

68
00:03:54.799 --> 00:04:01.044
Dr. Chilton was silent for a few moments before he said in a serious voice, "You can't always

69
00:04:01.084 --> 00:04:02.465
get a spouse just by asking."

70
00:04:04.207 --> 00:04:05.728
Pollyanna studied the doctor.

71
00:04:05.748 --> 00:04:10.192
"But I would think you'd be able to get one.

72
00:04:11.453 --> 00:04:13.936
Lots of women would be glad to marry you."

73
00:04:16.558 --> 00:04:18.760
Dr. Chilton raised his eyebrows and laughed.

74
00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:24.101
"I'm afraid some women aren't as confident about that as you are, young lady."

75
00:04:25.422 --> 00:04:27.582
Pollyanna's eyes widened in surprise.

76
00:04:27.602 --> 00:04:29.563
"Wait a minute!

77
00:04:30.083 --> 00:04:30.903
Are you like Mr.

78
00:04:30.943 --> 00:04:35.584
Pendleton? Did you try to get someone's hand and heart, and she turned you down?"

79
00:04:35.604 --> 00:04:41.166
"I'd do anything to have one particular woman's hand and heart."

80
00:04:41.226 --> 00:04:45.167
Dr. Chilton spoke so softly that Pollyanna had to strain to hear him.

81
00:04:45.187 --> 00:04:47.128
"What did you say?"

82
00:04:47.468 --> 00:04:47.928
she asked.

83
00:04:49.248 --> 00:04:50.989
Dr. Chilton abruptly stood up.

84
00:04:51.029 --> 00:04:53.731
"There, there, Pollyanna.

85
00:04:53.811 --> 00:04:54.911
Never mind about that now.

86
00:04:55.812 --> 00:04:57.813
Don't bother yourself with other people's troubles.

87
00:04:59.094 --> 00:05:00.534
It's time for you to run back to Mrs.

88
00:05:00.574 --> 00:05:04.717
Snow. I've written down the name of the medicine and directions for taking it.

89
00:05:06.618 --> 00:05:07.838
Was there anything else she needed?"

90
00:05:09.239 --> 00:05:10.340
Pollyanna shook her head.

91
00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:12.001
"No, sir.

92
00:05:12.381 --> 00:05:13.021
Thank you, sir."

93
00:05:15.683 --> 00:05:16.923
And she hurried back to Mrs.

94
00:05:16.963 --> 00:05:17.784
Snow and Fluffy.
